# Tooltip - a short name that shows while the pointer rests on something (or it gets the focus): what an icon-only
# button does, the full text of a cut-off line. Only a label: never a place for something the person must read.
# The kit's single tooltip (KitLayer) does it for anything with a name; Tooltip just gives that name.
#   Tooltip(text: "Editar servicio") { Btn(variant: "ghost", size: "icon", onClick: edit) { Icon "lucide:pencil" } }
# A Btn with label already has one. shadcn-for-muten · part · the kit's tooltip (.cx-tip).
part Tooltip(text: text) { Stack class("cx-tip-wrap") data(slot: "tooltip-trigger", name: $text) { slot } }
